@startuml
title UC-014 Maintain a Customer Record - Module Interaction
autonumber
actor Customer
participant "MOD-CI\nCustomer Interaction" as CI
participant "MOD-CM\nCustomer Management" as CM

Customer -> CI: maintainCustomerRecord(customerInformation)
CI -> CM: maintainCustomerRecord(customerReference, customerInformation)
CM -> CM: validateAuthorityAndProvenance()
CM --> CI: currentCustomerRecord
CI --> Customer: confirmed update
@enduml
